 would ever have happened  it was due to freezes policies and  actions that kal-el weight diving  Kakarot was sent to earth before the  destruction of his home planet setting  all the events of the entire series into  motion the  in ball series creator akira toriyama  was partially inspired to create Frieza  by the actions of predatory real-estate  investors in Japan except instead of  taking over homes and businesses Frieza  took control of entire planet and his  empire is believed to have encompassed  over 400 different planets and now for  the transformations in the world of  Dragon Ball transforming is the ability  to take on a different physical form  that allows access to higher levels of  power Frieza has multiple forms and  transformations both organic and  artificial and we will discuss them all  here in his very first form Frieza looks  like a small pink and purple demon with  a long tail at horn he is also primarily  seen in his hover pod or flying chair  and to me as a kid watching Dragon Ball  Z for the first time freezes appearance  in his first form combined with his  voice in the English dub reminded me of  an evil old lady but that only made him  even scarier when we realized the extent  of his power and of course even in this  form and sitting comfortably in his  hover pod he was able to destroy all of  Planet Vegeta without any trouble using  his super nova death beam his power  level in this form is known to be  530,000 to put that into perspective  think about how shot Vegeta was when he  saw that Goku's power level had reached  over 8,000 or 9,000 in the English  version by contrast breezes power level  in his first and weakest form is more  than 60 times higher than Goku's at that  point but that is only scratching the  surface of freezes true power in his  second form Frieza turns into a hawkish  version of his first form he becomes  taller and far more muscular and he  sheds his artificial armor as it can no  longer contain his massive frame in this  form freezes power level doubles to over  1 million Frieza third form makes him  look less human and more alien his head  becomes elongated and his face changes  so that he no longer has a nose it's  pretty safe to say that this form was  directly inspired by the alien from the  air  movie franchise in this form Frieza is  known to use the crazy finger beam  attack which allows him to fire multiple  death beams at once in rapid succession  causing incredible damage but even this  terrifying form does not represent the  true extent of freezes power then we  arrive at freezes final form or at least  we think it says final form at this  point in this final form Frieza goes  back to a smaller size and he loses his  horns this is his true form the form  that he was actually born in and unlike  Super Saiyans who reached higher forms  in order to become stronger Frieza  created his previous three forms as a  way of lowering and conserving his power  because in his true form he is so strong  that being in it for a long time will  drain his stamina but even in this final  form Frieza is able to hold back much of  his power he fights Goku at only 50% of  his ultimate power until Goku first  turns into a Super Saiyan at 50%  strength in his final form freezes power  level is 60 million and at 100% strength  his power level reaches an incredible  120 million according to the Dragon Ball  encyclopedia due to the fact that he  never had to use it since all of his  previous opponents were far too weak  Frieza never learned to master his final  form the reason Super Saiyan Goku is  able to defeat him on Namek is that  Frieza allows himself to take too much  damage before reaching 100% strength and  this weakens his body so that when he  doesn't reach 100% power he is unable to  stay at that level for long for this  reason his body eventually becomes  overwhelmed and the fact that he never  bothered to train and master his true  form is the primary reason why Goku is  ultimately able to defeat Frieza after  his defeat all Namek Frieza is on the  brink of death but he is found in his  severely injured state by his father  king cold and infused with cybernetic  parts which not only save his life but  also make him even stronger than he was  before Frieza feels so humiliated and  angry after his defeat to goku that he  sets out for earth to get revenge as  soon as his recovery is complete  it is believed that in his mecha form  Frieza is powerful enough to generate a  death ball that is 10 times stronger  than the one he used to destroy the  planet namek but we do not get to see  mecha Frieza in action for long because  once he arrives on earth he is quickly  destroyed by Future Trunks after his  death at the hands of Future Trunks  reason is eventually revived by his  henchmen using the power of the Dragon  Balls still obsessed with getting  revenge against Goku and now back in his  organic body Frieza actually dedicates  themselves to training in order to get  stronger and as a result he becomes the  first person to unlock the ultimate form  of his race the golden form golden  Frieza is taller than his previous form  and his body is now covered in an  organic golden armor this form is even  stronger than his original final form  and his power surpasses the Super Saiyan  blue forms of Goku and Vegeta however it  quickly becomes clear that Frieza cannot  sustain himself in his golden form for a  long period of time his golden form  expend so much energy that it drains his  stamina which eventually forces him to  revert back to his true form even though  he is able to attain incredible power in  his golden form especially when he  becomes angry he simply cannot control  it effectively as was the case during  his battle with Super Saiyan Goku on  Namek it appears that Frieza did not  train enough in his final form to be  able to control it he was too anxious to  exact his revenge on Goku and he didn't  take the time to perfect his golden 